1: # @apm-js-collab/code-transformer-bundler-plugins
2: 
3: A universal plugin that uses
4: [`@apm-js-collab/code-transformer`](https://github.com/apm-js-collab/orchestrion-js)
5: to instrument JavaScript code at build time for application performance
6: monitoring and tracing.
7: 
8: **Compatible with Rollup, Webpack, Vite, esbuild, Bun, and more!**
9: 
10: ## Installation
11: 
12: ```bash
13: npm install @apm-js-collab/code-transformer-bundler-plugins
14: # or
15: yarn add @apm-js-collab/code-transformer-bundler-plugins
16: # or
17: pnpm add @apm-js-collab/code-transformer-bundler-plugins
18: ```
19: 
20: ## Usage
